    {
      "type": "heading",
      "snippet": "Popular Coffee Brands & Beans"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "list": [
        {
          "snippet": "Stumptown Coffee Roasters: Praised for consistent, classic flavors like caramel, stewed berries, and lemon in their Holler Mountain Medium Roast blend.",
          "snippet_links": [
            {
              "text": "Stumptown Coffee Roasters",
              "link": "https://www.stumptowncoffee.com/"
            },
            {
              "text": "Holler Mountain Medium Roast",
              "link": "https://www.google.com/search?ibp=oshop&prds=pvt:hg,pvo:29,imageDocid:12869278968623821611,headlineOfferDocid:13625684045735528027,productDocid:13625684045735528027&q=product&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjcuIH5lP6RAxX8M1kFHbrZJ0EQxa4PegQIBBAD",
              "shopping_results_reference_index": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "snippet": "Onyx Coffee Lab: An award-winning roaster, their Monarch Blend is a versatile dark roast with notes of dark chocolate, red wine, and berries, suitable for both espresso and filter methods.",
          "snippet_links": [
            {
              "text": "Monarch Blend",
              "link": "https://www.google.com/search?ibp=oshop&prds=pvt:hg,pvo:29,imageDocid:14760833822932488324,headlineOfferDocid:1621222209587544194,productDocid:1621222209587544194&q=product&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjcuIH5lP6RAxX8M1kFHbrZJ0EQxa4PegQIBBAG",
              "shopping_results_reference_index": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "snippet": "La Colombe Coffee Roasters: Offers various roast levels and is committed to ethical sourcing and recyclable packaging. Their Nizza medium roast features notes of brownies and honey.",
          "snippet_links": [
            {
              "text": "La Colombe Coffee Roasters",
              "link": "https://www.lacolombe.com/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "snippet": "Death Wish Coffee: Known for being \"fiercely caffeinated,\" their dark roast blend is full-bodied with notes of cocoa and cherry, but without the harsh acidity sometimes found in dark roasts."
        },
        {
          "snippet": "Lavazza: An Italian classic, the Classico is a well-balanced medium roast blend of Arabica and Robusta beans, with notes of dried fruits and nuts.",
          "snippet_links": [
            {
              "text": "Classico",
              "link": "https://www.google.com/search?ibp=oshop&prds=pvt:hg,pvo:29,mid:576462839934773082,imageDocid:10038547600247220762,gpcid:7198787514972584488,headlineOfferDocid:13780097028519287328,catalogid:6006811230412219036,productDocid:6378918724502722678,rds:PC_7198787514972584488%7CPROD_PC_7198787514972584488&q=product&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjcuIH5lP6RAxX8M1kFHbrZJ0EQxa4PegQIBBAM",
              "shopping_results_reference_index": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "snippet": "Bones Coffee Company: Their Ethiopia Single-Origin Coffee is a light roast that highlights the bean's natural flavors, with notes of berries, citrus, and floral undertones, and is Rainforest Alliance certified.",
          "snippet_links": [
            {
              "text": "Ethiopia Single-Origin Coffee",
