  "reconstructed_markdown": "Coffee recommendations span a range of beans, roasts, and brewing methods.\n\n### Popular coffee brands and beans\n\n- Stumptown Coffee Roasters – classic medium roasts like Holler Mountain with caramel and citrus notes.\n- Onyx Coffee Lab – darker blends such as Monarch with chocolate and red‑wine flavors.\n- Lavazza – Italian medium roasts that balance Arabica and Robusta beans.\n- Bones Coffee Company – single‑origin light roasts that highlight fruity and floral profiles.\n\n### Factors to consider\n\n- **Roast level**: light (bright, acidic), medium (balanced), dark (bold, smoky).\n- **Origin**: different regions (for example, Ethiopia vs. Colombia) emphasize different flavor notes.\n- **Brewing method**: some coffees work better for pour‑over, others for espresso or immersion methods.",
